    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Therapeutic communication principles and techniques are frequently tested in nursing competitive exams.",
        "Classifications, indications, and side effects of psychiatric medications are high-yield exam topics.",
        "Identification of specific symptoms and nursing interventions for common mental disorders is critical for clinical questions."
